          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.149,
            0.322,
            0.375,
            0.341
          ],
          "content": "**Q. Is 8536 divisible by 4?**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.117,
            0.351,
            0.405,
            0.369
          ],
          "content": "Ans. Yes, as 36 is divisible by 4."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.116,
            0.378,
            0.381,
            0.395
          ],
          "content": "**Q. Consider these statements:**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.163,
            0.405,
            0.88,
            0.424
          ],
          "content": "**1. Only the last two digits matter when deciding if a given number is divisible by 4.**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.163,
            0.433,
            0.882,
            0.468
          ],
          "content": "**2. If the number formed by the last two digits is divisible by 4, then the original number is divisible by 4.**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.163,
            0.478,
            0.881,
            0.513
          ],
          "content": "**3. If the original number is divisible by 4, then the number formed by the last two digits is divisible by 4.**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.164,
            0.522,
            0.45,
            0.541
          ],
          "content": "**Do you agree? Why or why not?**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.117,
            0.55,
            0.238,
            0.566
          ],
          "content": "Ans. 1. Yes"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.176,
            0.576,
            0.238,
            0.594
          ],
          "content": "2. Yes"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.177,
            0.604,
            0.238,
            0.621
          ],
          "content": "3. Yes"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.178,
            0.632,
            0.297,
            0.649
          ],
          "content": "Yes,we agree."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.176,
            0.658,
            0.881,
            0.676
          ],
          "content": "Consider numbers 124,364,4028 etc. These are divisible by 4.Check for more numbers."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.116,
            0.713,
            0.233,
            0.731
          ],
          "content": "**Page no. 125**"
        },
        {
